## GCG IMPLEMENTATION IN 2023

In 2023, the Company will carry out the following activities as part of GCG implementation:

1. Improvement and updating of the Company's GCG policy.
2. Recommunicate the Code of Ethics and Corporate Culture Guidelines to new and existing employees.
3. The Company also conducts periodic internal evaluations to understand GCG conditions and identify things that need to be improved.

