## COMPANY-WIDE IMPLEMENTATION OF CODE OF CONDUCT

The code of conduct applies throughout the company. This must be understood and practiced by all employees of the Company without exception.

## SOCIALIZATION OF IMPLEMENTATION AND COMPLIANCE OF THE CODE OF ETHICS

The process of internalization and dissemination of the Code of Ethics and corporate values for all levels of the organization, including the Board of Commissioners, Board of Directors, and employees, is carried out through formal and informal communication media.

All new employees are required to sign a declaration stating that they understand and will abide by the Code of Conduct. Employees may also be reminded of this Code at any time during meetings, training activities, and internal company communications.

